WEBVTT

00:01:58.413 --> 00:02:04.038
It would be misery. And I think
that there is a task

00:02:04.038 --> 00:02:09.746
for society to reduce misery,
not to increase happiness.

00:02:10.079 --> 00:02:12.371
And when you think of reducing misery,

00:02:12.746 --> 00:02:16.704
you would be led into very different
policy directions.

00:02:17.204 --> 00:02:19.871
You would be led into mental
health issues.

00:02:19.871 --> 00:02:23.121
You would be led into a
lot of other problems.

00:02:23.788 --> 00:02:26.788
So reducing misery would be my focus.

00:02:27.621 --> 00:02:31.913
Character and happiness or misery
are not substitutes.